{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f About This Game \u2013 Motel Nightmares</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Motel Nightmares</i> is a first-person psychological horror experience that sends you deep into a supernatural mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unusual phenomena surrounding an abandoned roadside motel catch your attention. You set out to investigate the rumors firsthand \u2014 but what you find goes far beyond anything you imagined. The story begins with a car journey, but quickly descends into a disturbing, twisted reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the motel and uncover its dark past. Solve ominous puzzles, discover hidden clues, and try to escape the forces that now surround you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you uncover the truth \u2014 or become the motel\u2019s next lost soul?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde9 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person psychological horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story begins with vehicle exploration and unfolds gradually</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paranormal investigation and atmosphere-driven gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Environmental puzzles and immersive exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal UI for total immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No combat \u2014 just fear, survival, and mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Headphones strongly recommended</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795800?t=1751714800","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795800?t=1751714800","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795800/83a1c7ead9d57cba369b21ac84dd5d07439cf97a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751714800","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795